{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110683","id":2842699626,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6pcCdq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110683","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110683.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110683.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110683","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110683/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110683/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110683/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7e9cd5b0c982c47eed47b9d0fa64ddd82638db01","number":110683,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Metal: fix incorrect usage of `useResources:` APIs","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":" # Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR ensures resources are made resident _before_ their respective draw or dispatch calls rather than at the end of encoding.\r\n\r\nThis will lead to corruption during rendering.\r\n\r\n# Background\r\n\r\nThe correct usage of [`useResources:count:usage:stages:`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metal/mtlrendercommandencoder/useresources:count:usage:stages:?language=objc) and [`useResources:count:usage:`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/metal/mtlcomputecommandencoder/useresources:count:usage:?language=objc) was previously misunderstood, assuming that all resources must be made resident before calling `endEncoding` on the `MTLCommandEncoder`. The documentation is clear that resources used by subsequent draw calls must be made resident before encoding the draw or dispatch command:\r\n\r\n> You can make multiple resources resident (available in GPU memory) for the remaining duration of the render pass by calling this method. Call the method **before encoding draw calls that may access the elements of resources through an argument buffer**. The method ensures each resource is in a format that’s compatible with the shaders that depend on it.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-09-19T06:37:05Z","updated_at":"2025-12-02T18:33:16Z","closed_at":"2025-10-24T20:06:16Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"stuartcarnie:arg_buffer_resource_usage","ref":"arg_buffer_resource_usage","repo":{"id":702688448,"node_id":"R_kgDOKeIswA","name":"godot","full_name":"stuartcarnie/godot","owner":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":true,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Godot Engine – Multi-platform 2D and 3D game engine","homepage":"https://godotengine.org","language":"C++","visibility":"public","is_template":fa